# Only track mods/ and Workshop/ -- everything else in the Zomboid user
# data folder is game state, logs, or saves, not mod source/staging.
/*
!/mods/
!/Workshop/
!/.gitignore

# Never commit copyrighted audio the user supplies locally for personal-use
# addons (e.g. HARMONIE_LifestyleAudioTune's JoJo/He-Man instrument tracks) --
# this repo pushes to a public-ish GitLab remote, and these files are
# explicitly NOT meant to be redistributed. See media/sound/JoJo/README.txt
# and media/sound/HeMan/README.txt in that mod.
mods/HARMONIE_LifestyleAudioTune/42/media/sound/JoJo/*.ogg
mods/HARMONIE_LifestyleAudioTune/42/media/sound/HeMan/*.ogg
Workshop/HARMONIE_LifestyleAudioTune/Contents/mods/HARMONIE_LifestyleAudioTune/42/media/sound/JoJo/*.ogg
Workshop/HARMONIE_LifestyleAudioTune/Contents/mods/HARMONIE_LifestyleAudioTune/42/media/sound/HeMan/*.ogg
